# MIGRATIONS 001-038 ARE APPLIED TO PRODUCTION AND IMMUTABLE.
#
# One SHA-256 per file, over its content with line endings normalised to LF so
# a Windows checkout cannot make an untouched file look edited.
#
# scripts/migration-execution.test.mjs checks every line of this. Editing an
# applied migration now fails a test rather than relying on somebody noticing
# in review. If a hash here ever has to change, that is a decision somebody
# makes deliberately and explains -- not a diff that slips through.
#
# Recorded 2026-08-25, after the full chain was replayed on PostgreSQL 18 and
# every end-state assertion in all forty migrations passed.
